From: Stefan Haller <stefan@haller-berlin.de>
Date: Tue, 2 Sep 2025 12:08:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 07/21] git-gui: bring back Git Gui.app

This was removed upstream, but we want it, so revert the upstream commit
(df41037be019 in the git-gui repo).
